\pard\f0\fs20 OpenCam is free software: no ads, no premium tier, no account. Use it with any phone that speaks the DroidCam protocol, over your own local network, at your own risk and with no warranty.\par
\par
This setup puts the OpenCam client and its virtual camera under Program Files, registers the camera with Windows, adds a firewall exception so phones can be discovered on the local network, and adds a Start menu shortcut.\par
\par
Uninstalling OpenCam removes all of it.\par
